              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Wilemon"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was pretty good but not something I will make often. I put a little butter in the pan and used green chili peppers instead of jalapeno.",
            "datePublished": "2004-04-27T07:13:05.857Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DREGINEK"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My roommate and I really liked these whereas my boyfriend passed. Guess he likes his eggs without the tortillas. Instead of jalapeno pepper, I used 1/2 green &amp; 1/2 red sliced bell pepper. Also, I added a couple of shakes of hot sauce to the eggs. I couldn't bring myself to add sour cream or guacamole at the end but they were great without it. The more veggies the better in my opinion but overall, these were a tasty, unique breakfast.",
            "datePublished": "2003-09-18T20:25:26.187Z"
